SimulationType                MonteCarlo
NumberOfCycles                500
NumberOfInitializationCycles  100
PrintEvery                    50

Forcefield                    local
ChargeMethod                  Ewald
EwaldPrecision                1e-6
CutOffVDW                     12.8
CutOffCoulomb                 12.8
RemoveAtomNumberCodeFromLabel yes

ComputeEnergyHistogram        yes
ComputeNumberOfMoleculesHistogram yes

Framework 0
FrameworkName framework
UnitCells 2 2 1
HeliumVoidFraction 0.877
ExternalTemperature 298.0
ExternalPressure 1e4 5e4 1e5 5e5 1e6

Component 0 MoleculeName n-heptane
            MoleculeDefinition local
            SwapProbability 1.0
            TranslationProbability 1.0
            RotationProbability 1.0
            ReinsertionProbability 1.0
            CreateNumberOfMolecules 0

Component 1 MoleculeName CO2
            MoleculeDefinition local
            SwapProbability 1.0
            TranslationProbability 1.0
            RotationProbability 1.0
            ReinsertionProbability 1.0
            CreateNumberOfMolecules 0

